Phase Transition Prediction via Attention-Enhanced Rare Event Detection: A Machine Learning Approach to Critical Phenomena
(Dated: May 25, 2025)
We present a machine learning framework that combines attention mechanisms with rare event detection for predicting phase transitions in complex systems. Our approach integrates self-attention neural networks with large deviation theory to identify critical precursors and provide early warning signals before phase transitions occur.


